ans elsewhere. And yet then the thing that is actually quantified over is a=
 collection of predicates. It's just an arbitrary decision plopped into the=
 CLL, changing the type of a variable abruptly. My gripe about it is irrati=
onally amplified by my irrational mental attempts to statically type Lojban=
, but even putting that aside I'd say it's a valid gripe, albeit irrelevant=
 from a practical standpoint since predicate quantification has seen no use=
 so far as far as I know, except in my example here.
