 suo bu'a' don't seem to compute), but the embedded quantifiers are a main =
source of difficulty (pace xorxes) in reconstructing the logic of Lojban, s=
o this may not be a flaw.  What then is hackish?  The pattern of real Logic=
 is followed (less a mess of sub- and superscripts that are largely irrelev=
ant to Lojban).  Yes, Lojban is based on first order, but, then, so is seco=
nd order and Lojban allows that extension (and, in principle, all the other=
 orders on up).
